                <mxCell id="16" value="&lt;b&gt;1.4 Operational Bottlenecks (⚠️)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Chaotic Lyapunov limit (diverges after Day 3)&lt;br/&gt;• Coarse grid misses Wadi Hanifa &amp;amp; convective Haboobs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#F87171;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#991B1B;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
